{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphanageIntro-8944": "BEN: 等等。这他妈的——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphanageIntro-8945": "BEN: 给我点时间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphanageIntro-8946": "NIKOLAI: 他没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphanageIntro-8947": "AGATA: 应该没事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphanageIntro-8948": "AGATA: 我只见过一次，不过这里很像本长大的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphanageIntro-8949": "AGATA: 那段童年并不快乐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8950": "BEN: 嘿，孩子们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8951": "BOY: 你想干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8952": "BEN: 你们都有父母，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8953": "BOY: 你什么人，专门对小孩下手的变态？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8954": "BEN: 他们在这里干这种事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8955": "BOY: 这得问你吧，老兄。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8956": "GIRL: 这人怪怪的，谁去叫哈齐斯老师来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8957": "BOY: 不用，他敢乱来，我就揍扁他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8958": "BEN: 够了，我要把这鬼地方整个拆了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8959": "BOY: 哇，真酷。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8960": "GIRL: 让他停下！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8961": "WOMAN: 先生，有什么需要帮忙的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8962": "BEN: 有，给你三秒，这里是干什么的？那些孩子是谁？他们父母在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8963": "WOMAN: 先生，您不用这么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8964": "WOMAN: 这里是有机农场，兼汤力水灌装厂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8965": "BEN: 那孩子呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8966": "GIRL: 我们是学校组织来参观的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8967": "BEN: 是他们教你这么说的？我可以让这一切停下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8968": "GIRL: “他们”是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8969": "BOY: 谁也别想指使我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8970": "TEACHER: 同学们！时间到了，回车上去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8971": "BEN: 啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8972": "WOMAN: （我就一直说，别对外开放了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8973": "BEN: 这里的老板是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8974": "WOMAN: 老板是基里亚基斯先生，我不确定他今天在不在，可以去看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8975": "AGATA: 你不会再做什么傻事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8976": "AGATA: 这里应该没什么违法的事，除了产品标签上说的未必都是真的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8977": "BEN: 说不定还藏着个秘密地牢呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8978": "MAN: 先生，听说您有些问题？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8979": "BEN: 你就是基里亚基斯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8980": "MAN: 对，那是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8981": "MAN: ……我做生意用的名字。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8982": "BEN: 等等……斯塔尼？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8983": "MAN: 狄奥墨得斯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8984": "BEN: 真不敢信！斯塔尼！这里是你的！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8985": "STANI: 是啊，五年前买下的，本想把这儿整个推平，后来觉得可以改成汤力水灌装厂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8986": "STANI: 再后来，我妻子提议做这些健康食品。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8987": "STANI: 你们是狄奥墨得斯的朋友？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8988": "AGATA: 狄奥墨得斯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8989": "BEN: 我现在叫本。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8990": "STANI: 哦，对，我也改了名字。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8991": "STANI: 不过，各位请进，接待区现在正好没人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8992": "STANI: 我得和这个老疯子好好叙叙旧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8993": "STANI: 整个地方就是这样了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8994": "BEN: 看它变成这样，真不习惯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-notOrphans-8995": "STANI: 我去处理点事，马上回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-orphChat1-8996": "WOMAN: 以前都不知道有这么个地方！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-orphChat2-8997": "WOMAN: 是吧？城里哪儿找得到这种地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-orphNikolai-8998": "NIKOLAI: 回到这里，还好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-orphNikolai-8999": "BEN: 还没想明白呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-orphAlex-9000": "ALEXANDRA: 塞伦的有钱人肯定最喜欢这种地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-orphJuna-9001": "JUNA: 这个我能喝一整天。嗯……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-orphAgata-9002": "AGATA: 就我看到的，这确实是个卖高价东西的农场。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniAttendant-9003": "WOMAN: 基里亚基斯先生平常很……节俭，可他竟吩咐您要什么就给什么，我们都……挺惊讶的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniAgata-9004": "AGATA: 我跟他们讲了些你的经历，没有全说。那些不该由我来说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniAgata-9005": "CORDELIA: 即便如此，也已经令人心惊。对此，我深表同情。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniAgata-9006": "BEN: （这下真是什么稀奇话都听到了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniJerome-9007": "JEROME: 这些食品宣称的药用功效……也许有点夸大。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniJuna-9008": "JUNA: 这里的豇豆简直绝了。我才不管人类吃的那些是不是骗局。正直善良的尤鲁兽死后，肯定就来这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniZikaron-9009": "ZIKARON: ……回忆……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniAlexandra-9010": "ALEXANDRA: 你在这里长大的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniAlexandra-9011": "BEN: 唔……算是吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniNikolai-9012": "NIKOLAI: 这里卖的面包能把牙硌裂。味道也……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniNikolai-9013": "BEN: 对，就是骗钱的。根本没人真爱吃那玩意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9014": "STANI: 那么！等这趟……冒险结束，你还回阿科斯吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9015": "BEN: 唉，不知道，我一直都是走一步看一步。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9016": "BEN: 往后会怎么样，我真没底。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9017": "STANI: 哦！趁你还没走，有件事想告诉你，我见过卡珊德拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9018": "BEN: 什么？在哪儿？什么时候？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9019": "STANI: 在阿科斯，她也长大了，毕竟过去那么多年嘛，有一回她来过我的一家店，就那一次。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9020": "BEN: 她说什么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9021": "STANI: 你知道，她没……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9022": "STANI: 她已经不记得我了，连从前那些事也都忘了吧，还说自己不叫卡珊德拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9023": "STANI: 可肯定是她，脸颊上同样的痣，额头上同样的疤，缺了一角的牙，还有说话时那一点咬字不清。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9024": "STANI: 就是她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9025": "STANI: 说来也奇怪……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9026": "STANI: 她丈夫和孩子们也一起来了，孩子吵着说非要买些贵得离谱的破玩意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9027": "STANI: 她就笑着打趣了他们几句，再买了些别的给他们，一点事儿都没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9028": "STANI: 就是看见她那副模样，我才确信她是真的不记得了，换作我，孩子一嚷嚷自己“需要”什么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9029": "STANI: 我就得强忍着脾气，或者干脆让妻子去应付，因为那些孩子根本不懂什么才是真正的需要。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9030": "STANI: 而我们当年，可是再清楚不过了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9031": "BEN: 嗯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9032": "STANI: 卡茜已经把那些都忘了，现在过得很好，所以我什么也没再说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9033": "STANI: 话说回来，你怎么胖成这样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9034": "BEN: 可费了不少劲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9035": "BEN: 毕竟在厨房里干了二十年。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9036": "STANI: 那还有菜能端到客人面前吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9037": "BEN: 三盘里大概能有一盘吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9038": "STANI: 随时回来，买什么都给你大优惠。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniFinal-9039": "BEN: 谢谢，伙计。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-orphanageClerkTalker-9040": "WOMAN: 我们有多种优质保健饮品。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-npcStani-9041": "STANI: 随时回来，买什么都给你大优惠。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/benSidequest.yarn-staniLuckTome-9042": "找到幸运宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-javelinChestOpen1-9043": "BARBARIAN: 要选剑士披风吗？它能提高你闪避敌人攻击的能力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-javelinChestOpen1-9044": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-javelinChestOpen1-9045": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-javelinChestOpen2-9046": "BARBARIAN: 要选凯基亚斯吗？它能提高速度，以及打出暴击的几率。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-javelinChestOpen2-9047": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-javelinChestOpen2-9048": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-trialChestA-9049": "BARBARIAN: 要选剑士披风吗？它能提高你闪避敌人攻击的能力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-trialChestA-9050": "BARBARIAN: 打开这个宝箱，另一个就永远拿不到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-trialChestB-9051": "BARBARIAN: 要选凯基亚斯吗？它能提高速度，以及打出暴击的几率。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-trialChestB-9052": "BARBARIAN: 打开这个宝箱，另一个就永远拿不到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-trialAback-9053": "BARBARIAN: 守护者，先领取你的标枪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-trialBback-9054": "BARBARIAN: 守护者，先领取你的标枪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-trialItemChecking-9055": "BARBARIAN: 你已经做出选择了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-trialLeaveLastRoom-9056": "BARBARIAN: 守护者，再选一个宝箱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-trialLeaveLastRoom-9057": "BARBARIAN: 守护者，先领取你的标枪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-barbarianTalkTo-9058": "BARBARIAN: 守护者，再选一个宝箱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-barbarianTalkTo-9059": "BARBARIAN: 守护者，先领取你的标枪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/javelinQuest.yarn-javelinTimesUp-9060": "时间到！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3540": "Title: 卡珊德拉",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3541": "Description: 本想知道，孤儿院的老朋友卡珊德拉后来去了哪里。"
}
